{"id":"u-55b17e83-77be-42ed-a690-bbc168177d68","src":"community","title":"No Squat: Strength + Size","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/NykOBy-no-squat-strength-size","desc":"No Squat: Strength + Size is a full-body program built for lifters who want real muscle and real strength without ever loading a barbell onto their back. Whether you're working around cranky knees, a sensitive lower back, limited hip mobility, or you just don't enjoy squatting, this program proves you don't need the squat to build a powerful, well-developed physique.\n\nYou'll train three times a week, hitting the whole body each session with five compound and isolation movements for three sets of 8–12 reps — the classic rep range where strength and size overlap. Lower-body work is driven by the leg press and Romanian deadlift, so your quads, hamstrings, and glutes still get loaded hard, just without the spinal compression and technical demands of a back squat. Up top, pressing, rowing, and pulling movements build a balanced chest, back, and shoulders, while curls, lateral raises, and skull crushers add the detail work that rounds everything out.\n\nThe result is a simple, repeatable framework that keeps you progressing week after week: enough volume to grow, enough intensity to get stronger, and zero squats required.","level":["Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":3,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-17T23:44:03.490Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{